Third party material, not covered by the licences above:

- Package names, version numbers and publication times in battery.json and
  data/releases.json are facts taken from the public npm registry
  (registry.npmjs.org) and the Python Package Index (pypi.org) on 2026-10-19.
  They are reproduced as a derived, minimal extract for research. Use of the
  registries themselves is subject to their own terms (npm: the npm Open Source
  Terms; PyPI: the PyPI Terms of Use and the metadata supplied by package
  authors). The raw registry responses are not redistributed.
- prior/opus-5.md, prior/sonnet-5.md, prior/haiku-4-5.md and the excerpt in
  prior/models-overview-2026-10-19.md are snapshots of Anthropic documentation
  pages, kept as evidence of the stated cutoff dates. They remain Anthropic's.
- prior/s2.json holds raw responses of the Semantic Scholar Academic Graph API,
  subject to the Semantic Scholar API License Agreement. Paper titles and
  abstracts in it belong to their authors and publishers.
